# Court witness (2026-10-01 consolidation). Positive fixture: candidates hold SELECT authority with required receipts.
@prefix dfcm: <https://ggen.dev/ontology/dfcm#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
dfcm:CandidateWitness3 a dfcm:Candidate ; dfcm:authority dfcm:SELECT ; dfcm:requiresReceipt true .
